WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0064: WoW's merchant cursor over a vendor in BG3.

- wowbg3_cursors.rs: also merchant.cur, merchant-gray.cur and their pressed looks, from WoW's own
  Interface\Cursor\Buy.blp and UnableBuy.blp the way the quest cursors are made (each pair only when
  missing); the wowbg3-early plugin swaps BG3's OpenDoor cursors for them.
- wowbg3_lead.rs: a vendor under the pointer reads WoW's Buy cursor kind in wowhover.bin even when it
  also talks (gossip wins WoW's own cursor ladder, so most vendors read Speak; a playtest report:
  a merchant showed the talk cursor).

